@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 90
title Failover: term, permit и живой процесс различны
participant "Old orchestrator\nterm 14" as old
participant "Authority" as a
participant "New orchestrator\nterm 15" as new
participant "Executor" as e
participant "Sandbox g3" as s
a -> e : permit op-53 under term 14
e -> s : start process h3
a -> a : commit halt + term 15
new -> a : resume from committed checkpoint
old -> a : renew / assign with term 14
a --> old : stale_term
e -> a : request next dispatch permit
a --> e : refused after halt
a -> e : stop control message
e -> s : terminate h3
s --> e : actual terminal observation
e -> a : old epoch/g3 historical receipt
alt restart sandbox
 e -> e : allocate generation 4
 new -> e : poll old handle h3
 e --> new : session_lost; no process-memory recovery
end
note over a,e
Partition denies new strict-online permits.
Previously admitted effects require explicit reconciliation.
end note
@enduml
